
### Get an uncached entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/app/Foo

### Get a cached entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/app/CachedFoo

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/app/Products


### Get all products with caching and key tracking
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/app/CachedFoo?$expand=products,bar

### Get all products with caching and key tracking
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/app/Foo?$expand=products,bar


# The caching API requires an authenticated user. These use CAP's mocked
# authentication: alice with an empty password, sent as Basic YWxpY2U6.
#
# Operations that touch the store use `caching-northwind`, which is backed by
# SQLite and so works without Redis running. Swap in `caching` once Redis is up.

### List the configured caches
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/caching-api/Caches
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6

### Rejected without credentials (401)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/caching-api/Caches

### List cache entries (paginated: at most 1000 per call, 100 by default)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/caching-api/Caches('caching-northwind')/getEntries(top=10,skip=0)
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6

### Read the collected metrics
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/caching-api/Metrics?$top=10
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6

### Turn on key-level metrics
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/caching-api/Caches('caching')/setKeyMetricsEnabled
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true }

### Flush the cache — needed once after upgrading to 3.0, since keys changed
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/caching-api/Caches('caching-northwind')/clear
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6
